">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The Flat Door is a door with no door handle or any special paneling. Once the Flat Door's schematic is filled, anyone with property edit permissions can change the direction the door swings in, or open/close the door. Much like any other door, any player can choose to knock on the door.\n</p><p>Laying the Flat Door on its side allows the builder to create trapdoors/hatches.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163218\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.042 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 58/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 56/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019435/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.919      1 Template:Schematics\n100.00%   37.919      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2392-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163218 and revision id 12507. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Schematics"],"links":[{"title":"Ferwater Island","exists":true},{"title":"Illumine Designs","exists":true}],"images":["Imagem_2023-07-13_164027008.png"]}
